    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build it. Master it. Win with pure will.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge the ultimate ARMORED CORE with your own hands.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Series Overview</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ARMORED CORE MOBILE 2</i> is a port of the classic title originally released in 2005 for feature phones, part of FromSoftware acclaimed 3D mech action series, <i>ARMORED CORE.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Gameplay Features</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This enhanced version brings the action to life with a powerful new back-view perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your mercenary skills through training missions, including evasion drills, MT battles, and survival exercises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the Arena Mode, where you'll face off in intense 1-on-1 battles against unique Ravens, each with their own tactics\u2014fight your way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 50 parts, including weapons and mech components!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for power, go for style\u2014the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate machine that reflects your own vision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713380/extras/823de7206788408348e4e0662a48534f.avif?t=1750258909\" width=800 height=671 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build it. Master it. Win with pure will.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge the ultimate ARMORED CORE with your own hands.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Series Overview</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ARMORED CORE MOBILE 2</i> is a port of the classic title originally released in 2005 for feature phones, part of FromSoftware acclaimed 3D mech action series, <i>ARMORED CORE.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Gameplay Features</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This enhanced version brings the action to life with a powerful new back-view perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your mercenary skills through training missions, including evasion drills, MT battles, and survival exercises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the Arena Mode, where you'll face off in intense 1-on-1 battles against unique Ravens, each with their own tactics\u2014fight your way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 50 parts, including weapons and mech components!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for power, go for style\u2014the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate machine that reflects your own vision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713380/extras/823de7206788408348e4e0662a48534f.avif?t=1750258909\" width=800 height=671 /></span></p>",
